1
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

2
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,440
<font color="#ffffff">You two, come with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,040
<font color="#ffffff">To Kamnan Sawaeng?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

4
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,400
<font color="#ffffff">I'm from the authorities.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,560
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

6
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,960
<font color="#ffffff">What's your business here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:58,360
<font color="#ffffff">-I suggest that you…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Do you remember me?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

8
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,280
<font color="#ffffff">You saved my life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

9
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:04,560
<font color="#ffffff">You're Saranya, the journalist.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

10
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:06,400
<font color="#ffffff">If the monk has the diamond,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

11
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,280
<font color="#ffffff">we'll never get it back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:12,080
<font color="#ffffff">The person who knows best</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">about the diamond is Boonrod.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

13
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,840
<font color="#ffffff">Are you saying</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:17,800
<font color="#ffffff">you have nothing to do with it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:22,000
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you take Luang Pho Suea?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,680
<font color="#ffffff">To a private interrogation.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,320
<font color="#ffffff">Is that even allowed?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

18
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:27,000
<font color="#ffffff">Isn't that against regulations?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">The Thai side! We made it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, watch out!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

21
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,560
<font color="#ffffff">I don't think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

22
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'll make it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:49,800
<font color="#ffffff">Listen.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

24
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not going to make it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

25
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,640
<font color="#ffffff">You cross over first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:58,000
<font color="#ffffff">Stop saying things like that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,240
<font color="#ffffff">Just being able to save you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">makes this second chance at life</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:08,080
<font color="#ffffff">completely worth it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">Tell Luang Pho</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:17,640
<font color="#ffffff">to dedicate some prayers</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for my soul, okay?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

32
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:20,920
<font color="#ffffff">Don't say your last words!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:23,400
<font color="#ffffff">You can't die here!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:29,360
<font color="#ffffff">You have to come back with me! Together!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

35
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,200
<font color="#ffffff">How are you feeling?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,040
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,560
<font color="#ffffff">Am I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:55,040
<font color="#ffffff">Am I not dead?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:57,840
<font color="#ffffff">Let me see that wound.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">The fangs that bit you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,680
<font color="#ffffff">belong to a non-venomous snake.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

44
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">That means you're going to live!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,160
<font color="#ffffff">I completely thought I was a goner.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,640
<font color="#ffffff">I can't believe it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

47
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,840
<font color="#ffffff">You idiot!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">You should've believed you'd make it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

49
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,320
<font color="#ffffff">What a weirdo.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,480
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,240
<font color="#ffffff">for worrying about me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,600
<font color="#ffffff">Do you remember me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,760
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,640
<font color="#ffffff">Or rather…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:02,160
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:05,200
<font color="#ffffff">How long has it been since we last met?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:09,400
<font color="#ffffff">Probably since the day</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you ordered Captain Chansuek<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

58
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,280
<font color="#ffffff">to throw me into prison.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">Right…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">So you still remember.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,000
<font color="#ffffff">Listen up, boys.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

62
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:47,040
<font color="#ffffff">We have to guard this narcotics</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">storage closely tonight.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

63
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">If these seized narcotics hit the market,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:52,760
<font color="#ffffff">they're worth a fortune.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:58,200
<font color="#ffffff">I reckon they might raid us</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to reclaim them tonight.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

66
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,680
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, sir!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, sir!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

67
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:08,160
<font color="#ffffff">Understood, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">Chief.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">Headquarters wants you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in town immediately.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

71
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">-Is it that urgent?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, sir.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

72
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,920
<font color="#ffffff">All right then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,480
<font color="#ffffff">Keep your eyes peeled.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

74
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:22,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't let your guard down. I'll be back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,640
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, sir!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, sir!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

76
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,920
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:32,799
<font color="#ffffff">Who the hell played a prank on me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with that urgent meeting?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

78
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:35,280
<font color="#ffffff">There wasn't a single soul there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,200
<font color="#ffffff">A fire?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:01,120
<font color="#ffffff">Chief…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,160
<font color="#ffffff">Sanit!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">While the raid was taking place,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,440
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej, the unit commander,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:25,720
<font color="#ffffff">suddenly left on personal business.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:31,600
<font color="#ffffff">He claims a fake HQ call</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">lured him to town,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

86
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">but no one was there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,400
<font color="#ffffff">According to our investigation…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,120
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:41,280
<font color="#ffffff">is close to the locals.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">He once acted as</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">a representative for the villagers<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

91
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,800
<font color="#ffffff">to demand justice for a suspect.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:48,880
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">I've received multiple reports</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">that Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:57,320
<font color="#ffffff">is an informant for the criminals.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">I am certain he had a hand</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">in this theft of evidence.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

98
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,560
<font color="#ffffff">-Freeze! Don't move!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

99
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,040
<font color="#ffffff">-Freeze!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What is this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

100
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,240
<font color="#ffffff">Put your gun down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:08,680
<font color="#ffffff">Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:12,160
<font color="#ffffff">This gun and this money aren't mine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

103
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:15,360
<font color="#ffffff">How did they end up here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

104
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,240
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej, you're under arrest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:20,240
<font color="#ffffff">Take him into custody.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,680
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you get that money?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:37,840
<font color="#ffffff">I already told you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,160
<font color="#ffffff">I know nothing about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,560
<font color="#ffffff">I was framed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:45,800
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">I know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,640
<font color="#ffffff">you've done a lot of good work</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:55,160
<font color="#ffffff">over your 40 years of service.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

114
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:56,720
<font color="#ffffff">But</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,000
<font color="#ffffff">if you cooperate,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:01,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go easier on you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,920
<font color="#ffffff">You know it, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:12,120
<font color="#ffffff">I've done good for nearly 40 years.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

119
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,800
<font color="#ffffff">But if what I've done</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:20,480
<font color="#ffffff">isn't enough to clear my name</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in everyone's eyes,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

121
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:23,040
<font color="#ffffff">then go ahead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:26,200
<font color="#ffffff">Punish me however you like.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:33,520
<font color="#ffffff">What did he say, Captain?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

124
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:35,240
<font color="#ffffff">He denies all charges.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:43,800
<font color="#ffffff">Fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

126
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:47,120
<font color="#ffffff">If he wants to be a thief,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:50,520
<font color="#ffffff">then let him rot in prison.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">This is exactly</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:07,560
<font color="#ffffff">why people lose faith in religion.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,800
<font color="#ffffff">You got out of prison</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">and went straight into the holy robe.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:14,880
<font color="#ffffff">When a cop</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:17,480
<font color="#ffffff">breaks the law, he just goes to jail.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

134
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,840
<font color="#ffffff">But when a monk does evil,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:23,080
<font color="#ffffff">you're going to hell.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad to know that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:28,400
<font color="#ffffff">you still believe</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:31,680
<font color="#ffffff">in sin, virtue, and hell.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:42,640
<font color="#ffffff">How did you manipulate my man?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:45,440
<font color="#ffffff">Why did Captain Chansuek team up with you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,440
<font color="#ffffff">to steal that seized diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

142
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">You quickly jumped to the conclusion</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:52,560
<font color="#ffffff">that Captain Chansuek stole it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">It reminds me very much</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:58,160
<font color="#ffffff">of my own past.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:03,160
<font color="#ffffff">At first, I didn't think Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">would have the guts.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

147
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:07,320
<font color="#ffffff">But seeing you with him makes me certain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">Birds of a feather flock together.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

149
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,320
<font color="#ffffff">A new-generation crooked cop</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,320
<font color="#ffffff">meeting a senior crooked cop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

151
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:22,960
<font color="#ffffff">So Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

152
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:25,080
<font color="#ffffff">is being made a scapegoat,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:28,440
<font color="#ffffff">just like I was in the past, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,920
<font color="#ffffff">Just answer my question.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:42,320
<font color="#ffffff">How did you trick Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">into stealing that diamond</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and running away with you?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

157
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:50,280
<font color="#ffffff">I've already told you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:52,200
<font color="#ffffff">It was pure coincidence.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

159
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">Perhaps he and I share some past karma</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:14:58,160 --> 00:15:00,200
<font color="#ffffff">which brought us to this point.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:02,080
<font color="#ffffff">Stop playing dumb.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:05,480
<font color="#ffffff">I don't buy your story</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:10,120
<font color="#ffffff">about finding him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in the forest with amnesia.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

164
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:13,480
<font color="#ffffff">It's just a pathetic act you two put on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:15:15,040 --> 00:15:17,400
<font color="#ffffff">When did you start conspiring with him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">Right after you got out of prison?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:27,080
<font color="#ffffff">You asked me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">and I told you the truth.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,760
<font color="#ffffff">Don't talk garbage to me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">It is greed,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

171
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:36,000
<font color="#ffffff">status, and praise</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,880
<font color="#ffffff">that blind you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:41,000
<font color="#ffffff">to what is right and wrong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,680
<font color="#ffffff">Cut the clever wordplay!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:45,600
<font color="#ffffff">This isn't a pulpit.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

176
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:48,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'm asking you nicely</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">out of respect for your title.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

177
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,800
<font color="#ffffff">If you believe I am guilty,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

178
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:57,880
<font color="#ffffff">then send me to the proper interrogation.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

179
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'll give you two hours.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

180
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">If I come back</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and you still refuse to talk,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

181
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:13,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'll have to treat you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,880
<font color="#ffffff">like any ordinary criminal.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:29,800
<font color="#ffffff">Who is that old man, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

184
00:16:29,880 --> 00:16:32,480
<font color="#ffffff">Why is he so terrifying?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:45,000
<font color="#ffffff">Welcome, Mr. Paul.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

186
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:51,080
<font color="#ffffff">I just realized these three</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:54,440
<font color="#ffffff">are the same people you're looking for.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

188
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:55,880
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, General.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

189
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:58,800
<font color="#ffffff">Too bad I couldn't warn you in time.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:03,400
<font color="#ffffff">They brought a crew</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and completely trashed my camp.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

191
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,480
<font color="#ffffff">Once I catch them,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:08,319
<font color="#ffffff">I'll hang their heads right outside</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for everyone to see.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

193
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">They aren't the only ones</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,319
<font color="#ffffff">who raided you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,960
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng's men did too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

196
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,920
<font color="#ffffff">That bastard Sawaeng?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

197
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,440
<font color="#ffffff">What about him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

198
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">Sawaeng's men want what Chansuek has too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

199
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:34,640
<font color="#ffffff">Sawaeng and I have been</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">at each other's throats for ages.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

200
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:38,800
<font color="#ffffff">I've always wanted to kill him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,400
<font color="#ffffff">Once this job is done,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:45,680
<font color="#ffffff">I plan to wipe them out anyway.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

203
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'll help you with that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

204
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:59,120
<font color="#ffffff">So what brings you here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">Right now, they're hiding out</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in the forest around here.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

206
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:07,000
<font color="#ffffff">Once you capture them,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:10,080
<font color="#ffffff">hand Chansuek over to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">He's the only one I want.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,400
<font color="#ffffff">I can give you anything for that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:20,800
<font color="#ffffff">So the item he's carrying</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is really that valuable?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

211
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,360
<font color="#ffffff">It's nothing special.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

212
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:26,240
<font color="#ffffff">Just a diamond worth a few bucks.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

213
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:28,480
<font color="#ffffff">But it's more about pride now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,600
<font color="#ffffff">since he dared to cross me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:37,120
<font color="#ffffff">I've had my men hunting them day</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and night, but we found no trace.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

216
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:39,640
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know if he's dead</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">or if he already crossed over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

218
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:46,480
<font color="#ffffff">I have plenty of information on them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:49,040
<font color="#ffffff">I know exactly who they are.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:52,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'll help you track them down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:55,440
<font color="#ffffff">Excellent.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

222
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:00,080
<font color="#ffffff">General,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:02,280
<font color="#ffffff">I'd also like to request some backup</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:19:02,360 --> 00:19:05,720
<font color="#ffffff">in case we clash with the police</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">or Sawaeng's men again.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

225
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">Of course!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:14,800
<font color="#ffffff">Take as many men as you need.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">But there's a catch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

228
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,000
<font color="#ffffff">If you catch them,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

229
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:22,920
<font color="#ffffff">I only want the woman named Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

230
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,200
<font color="#ffffff">Send her to me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

231
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:28,240
<font color="#ffffff">and I'll punish her myself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

232
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,200
<font color="#ffffff">Deal.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,040
<font color="#ffffff">Sakon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:45,320
<font color="#ffffff">General Kao has authorized us</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to search his territory.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

235
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:47,920
<font color="#ffffff">Go hunt down Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

236
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:49,280
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:58,320
<font color="#ffffff">With General Kao's extra muscle,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

238
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:01,440
<font color="#ffffff">dealing with Sawaeng's men</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">will be a breeze.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

239
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:03,400
<font color="#ffffff">Paul.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,320
<font color="#ffffff">What if Sakon</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">fails to catch Chansuek and his group?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:11,080
<font color="#ffffff">What do we do then?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:20:13,040 --> 00:20:14,480
<font color="#ffffff">I have a backup plan for you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:17,080
<font color="#ffffff">What kind of plan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

245
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:23,680
<font color="#ffffff">Those three are tightly knit.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:20:23,760 --> 00:20:25,840
<font color="#ffffff">They go everywhere together.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

247
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,520
<font color="#ffffff">Even when captured,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

248
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:29,600
<font color="#ffffff">they risked their lives for one another.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

249
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:34,560
<font color="#ffffff">So if Chansuek and that woman</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">make it out alive,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

250
00:20:35,760 --> 00:20:38,560
<font color="#ffffff">they'll definitely go find that monk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

251
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:50,960
<font color="#ffffff">BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

253
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:08,360
<font color="#ffffff">You can't just take Luang Pho</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for interrogation like this!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

254
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:09,760
<font color="#ffffff">Calm down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:21:09,840 --> 00:21:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'll look into it first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

256
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:12,840
<font color="#ffffff">How am I supposed to calm down?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

257
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">God knows what they're doing to him!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:35,040
<font color="#ffffff">Hold on!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:21:38,560 --> 00:21:40,280
<font color="#ffffff">Careful.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:47,480
<font color="#ffffff">You idiot!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

261
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:55,720
<font color="#ffffff">We finally made it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:21:57,440 --> 00:22:01,320
<font color="#ffffff">Let's cross over before celebrating.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">We still have a river to cross.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

263
00:22:02,160 --> 00:22:03,360
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:05,560
<font color="#ffffff">This is nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:09,080
<font color="#ffffff">By the way, how's your foot?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

266
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:13,160
<font color="#ffffff">-Let me test it out.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

267
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:15,720
<font color="#ffffff">-Hold on.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-All right.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

268
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">I'm fine now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

269
00:22:26,520 --> 00:22:27,760
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:30,040
<font color="#ffffff">for worrying about me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:32,000
<font color="#ffffff">after that snake bite.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:36,040
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you for coming to save me too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

273
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:39,000
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:22:40,320 --> 00:22:41,360
<font color="#ffffff">Be careful.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:22:45,800 --> 00:22:46,760
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:22:46,840 --> 00:22:48,440
<font color="#ffffff">Even after we cross over,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:22:48,520 --> 00:22:50,920
<font color="#ffffff">you need to be extremely careful.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

278
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:52,160
<font color="#ffffff">Right now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:54,520
<font color="#ffffff">you're a high-profile target.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

280
00:22:54,600 --> 00:22:56,320
<font color="#ffffff">You can't trust anyone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">Everyone is after you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

282
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:02,680
<font color="#ffffff">Once greed takes over good people,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:23:03,280 --> 00:23:04,640
<font color="#ffffff">it blinds them completely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:23:06,760 --> 00:23:09,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's not all that bad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

285
00:23:09,120 --> 00:23:11,640
<font color="#ffffff">At least I have you and Luang Pho</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

286
00:23:11,720 --> 00:23:14,040
<font color="#ffffff">that I can trust completely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:23:14,800 --> 00:23:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">I hope you aren't one of them,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:19,440
<font color="#ffffff">working undercover just to catch me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:25,160
<font color="#ffffff">Are you insane?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:27,120
<font color="#ffffff">Who has that kind of free time?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

291
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:37,880
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, right over there!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

292
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:43,720
<font color="#ffffff">Go grab him!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:23:53,120 --> 00:23:54,680
<font color="#ffffff">Crap, those are Thai soldiers!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:23:54,760 --> 00:23:55,720
<font color="#ffffff">Fall back!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:07,920
<font color="#ffffff">Officers! I'm Thai!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

296
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:09,200
<font color="#ffffff">I'm Thai too, sir!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:24:09,800 --> 00:24:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm Thai!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:17,640
<font color="#ffffff">We made it, Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:24:23,120 --> 00:24:25,200
<font color="#ffffff">Oops!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:24:26,560 --> 00:24:28,440
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's move.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Again?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

301
00:24:30,240 --> 00:24:33,480
<font color="#ffffff">Just move before they come back for us.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

302
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:38,720
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go, hurry up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

303
00:24:44,800 --> 00:24:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">Officers!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:24:52,560 --> 00:24:53,520
<font color="#ffffff">BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:24:53,600 --> 00:24:57,360
<font color="#ffffff">What authority do you have</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to take Luang Pho away like this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

307
00:24:57,960 --> 00:25:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">Is this even standard procedure?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

308
00:25:04,600 --> 00:25:05,920
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Ya,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

309
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:07,200
<font color="#ffffff">what's your problem?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

310
00:25:07,800 --> 00:25:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you take Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:12,240
<font color="#ffffff">To an interrogation.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:25:12,320 --> 00:25:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">Interrogation? Then do it at the station!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

313
00:25:15,080 --> 00:25:17,720
<font color="#ffffff">How can you take him away</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for interrogation like this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

314
00:25:17,800 --> 00:25:20,840
<font color="#ffffff">Listen, this is a sensitive matter.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:25:20,920 --> 00:25:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">And the higher-ups</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">have already reviewed it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

316
00:25:24,320 --> 00:25:27,440
<font color="#ffffff">So you can just kidnap anyone</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">because it's "sensitive"?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

317
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:29,960
<font color="#ffffff">Kidnap?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:25:30,040 --> 00:25:32,400
<font color="#ffffff">He was taken by a superior officer,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:34,440
<font color="#ffffff">not some criminal.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

320
00:25:34,520 --> 00:25:36,360
<font color="#ffffff">They're the worst of all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:25:36,440 --> 00:25:37,800
<font color="#ffffff">Release Luang Pho immediately,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:39,840
<font color="#ffffff">or I'll blow this up in the news</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:43,120
<font color="#ffffff">as a major case of police abuse of power!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

324
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:44,280
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

325
00:25:45,080 --> 00:25:47,920
<font color="#ffffff">Are you threatening us?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

326
00:25:48,560 --> 00:25:50,200
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:25:50,280 --> 00:25:51,520
<font color="#ffffff">I mean it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:56,680
<font color="#ffffff">What was inappropriate, Captain Kan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:25:56,760 --> 00:26:00,280
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I was just questioning a suspect.</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Any problem with that?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

330
00:26:00,360 --> 00:26:01,320
<font color="#ffffff">But sir…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

331
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:02,800
<font color="#ffffff">I am your superior.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

332
00:26:02,880 --> 00:26:05,520
<font color="#ffffff">Your only job is to follow my orders.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:08,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

334
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:14,560
<font color="#ffffff">Captain,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

335
00:26:15,160 --> 00:26:16,240
<font color="#ffffff">we have a problem.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

336
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:20,880
<font color="#ffffff">Be honest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:22,680
<font color="#ffffff">Are you in on this with them?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

338
00:26:23,640 --> 00:26:27,080
<font color="#ffffff">I've been suspicious</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">ever since you started tailing us.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

339
00:26:27,160 --> 00:26:28,000
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

340
00:26:28,080 --> 00:26:29,680
<font color="#ffffff">What do you mean?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

341
00:26:29,760 --> 00:26:31,760
<font color="#ffffff">Should I sue you for defamation?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:26:31,840 --> 00:26:33,160
<font color="#ffffff">Go right ahead!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:37,440
<font color="#ffffff">Then I'll countersue you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for obstructing a police officer!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

344
00:26:37,520 --> 00:26:38,680
<font color="#ffffff">Do it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:26:38,760 --> 00:26:42,000
<font color="#ffffff">So I can dig through</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">your internal records,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

346
00:26:42,080 --> 00:26:45,080
<font color="#ffffff">and expose all the corrupt cops,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:26:45,160 --> 00:26:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">including the one standing right here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:26:49,120 --> 00:26:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">Hold on, Lieutenant!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:26:53,800 --> 00:26:55,080
<font color="#ffffff">Ya, what is going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:57,960
<font color="#ffffff">She's demanding we let Luang Pho go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:26:58,920 --> 00:27:01,000
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder what she is hoping to achieve.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

352
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:04,840
<font color="#ffffff">Let's talk inside.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:06,360
<font color="#ffffff">No!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

354
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:08,680
<font color="#ffffff">Not until you release Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:27:08,760 --> 00:27:10,600
<font color="#ffffff">Stop making a scene. Come on!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:15,280
<font color="#ffffff">If you take his side,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">then just stay right here together.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

357
00:27:18,600 --> 00:27:20,280
<font color="#ffffff">Listen up, everyone!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:27:20,360 --> 00:27:24,680
<font color="#ffffff">The police are abusing their power</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and committing misconduct!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

359
00:27:24,760 --> 00:27:28,280
<font color="#ffffff">They bypassed the law</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to interrogate Luang Pho!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

360
00:27:28,360 --> 00:27:31,560
<font color="#ffffff">If they can do this to an innocent monk,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:27:31,640 --> 00:27:34,920
<font color="#ffffff">what makes you think you won't be next?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:35,960
<font color="#ffffff">Is this acceptable?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

363
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:38,120
<font color="#ffffff">-No!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Will you stand for this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

364
00:27:38,200 --> 00:27:40,640
<font color="#ffffff">-Never!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-We won't! Never!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

365
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:46,520
<font color="#ffffff">-We won't stand for this.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, we won't!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

366
00:27:46,600 --> 00:27:50,480
<font color="#ffffff">-Release him now!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-By what right are you doing this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

367
00:27:51,320 --> 00:27:53,080
<font color="#ffffff">You're breaking the law,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

368
00:27:53,160 --> 00:27:55,000
<font color="#ffffff">and I will sue you for it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:27:59,440 --> 00:28:00,600
<font color="#ffffff">Sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

370
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:02,760
<font color="#ffffff">What now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

371
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">A reporter is leading a protest</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to free Luang Pho Suea.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

372
00:28:06,800 --> 00:28:07,880
<font color="#ffffff">A reporter?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

373
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">How do they know about this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:28:10,320 --> 00:28:12,040
<font color="#ffffff">Her name is Saranya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:28:12,120 --> 00:28:13,960
<font color="#ffffff">She's Captain Kan's ex-girlfriend.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:28:14,560 --> 00:28:16,840
<font color="#ffffff">She went into the forest with us too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:18,320
<font color="#ffffff">I told you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:28:18,400 --> 00:28:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">Never let reporters get involved!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:23,400
<font color="#ffffff">I tried to stop her, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:28:24,040 --> 00:28:26,160
<font color="#ffffff">But Captain Kan let her come along.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:29,840
<font color="#ffffff">Get her inside the station first</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:32,520
<font color="#ffffff">and keep the villagers out of this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:28:33,080 --> 00:28:34,640
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Too late, sir.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

384
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:36,440
<font color="#ffffff"><i>The villagers are already here.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

385
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:39,920
<font color="#ffffff">She threatened to call more reporters</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

386
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">if we don't release the monk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:28:45,720 --> 00:28:46,920
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

388
00:29:01,080 --> 00:29:03,080
<font color="#ffffff">Daeng radioed from the forest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

389
00:29:04,360 --> 00:29:07,240
<font color="#ffffff">He said Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">made it back to the Thai side.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

390
00:29:08,520 --> 00:29:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">Dad, do you think he'll find</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

391
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,320
<font color="#ffffff">If they're in on it together,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

392
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:16,040
<font color="#ffffff">he'll definitely come help him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:29:17,800 --> 00:29:19,760
<font color="#ffffff">Where is Luang Pho Suea now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

394
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:23,080
<font color="#ffffff">The police still have him, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

395
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:36,600
<font color="#ffffff">BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:30:14,520 --> 00:30:15,680
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:30:18,880 --> 00:30:19,760
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

398
00:30:19,840 --> 00:30:21,840
<font color="#ffffff">Are you safe?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:25,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm fine. I'm okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:30:48,320 --> 00:30:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:30:50,520 --> 00:30:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">Look.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

402
00:30:51,920 --> 00:30:55,160
<font color="#ffffff">Isn't that the monk</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng's after?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

403
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:56,440
<font color="#ffffff">Just go already.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:02,920
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">for giving me shelter.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:09,280
<font color="#ffffff">A temple should always be</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">a refuge for those in trouble.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

407
00:31:09,360 --> 00:31:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">It's no big deal.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:31:31,520 --> 00:31:32,840
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

409
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:38,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'll stay here for a while</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:31:38,560 --> 00:31:40,520
<font color="#ffffff">and wait for news</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

411
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:41,880
<font color="#ffffff">from my followers.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:31:42,520 --> 00:31:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">Also, just in case the police</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

413
00:31:44,480 --> 00:31:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">want to question me more.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:52,520
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you both very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:31:53,800 --> 00:31:55,280
<font color="#ffffff">No problem.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:31:55,360 --> 00:31:58,120
<font color="#ffffff">Are you really going to stay here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:32:00,640 --> 00:32:02,680
<font color="#ffffff">I did nothing wrong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:32:02,760 --> 00:32:04,800
<font color="#ffffff">Why should I run?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:32:05,920 --> 00:32:07,960
<font color="#ffffff">Even if I did</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

420
00:32:08,040 --> 00:32:10,600
<font color="#ffffff">and ran far away,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

421
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:13,560
<font color="#ffffff">my guilt and sins</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

422
00:32:13,640 --> 00:32:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">would still follow me everywhere.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

423
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:19,800
<font color="#ffffff">You're not wrong,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

424
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:22,600
<font color="#ffffff">but they'll blame you anyway,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

425
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:24,280
<font color="#ffffff">just like last time.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:32:26,720 --> 00:32:28,880
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want you jailed for nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

427
00:32:30,200 --> 00:32:31,520
<font color="#ffffff">I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:32:31,600 --> 00:32:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">But if that happens,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

429
00:32:33,920 --> 00:32:36,880
<font color="#ffffff">it must be my karma.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:32:38,080 --> 00:32:40,920
<font color="#ffffff">If I have to pay it back in this life</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

431
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,280
<font color="#ffffff">once again,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

432
00:32:42,920 --> 00:32:44,480
<font color="#ffffff">so be it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:32:45,520 --> 00:32:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">That way,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

434
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">I won't have to carry it</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">into the next life.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

435
00:32:54,920 --> 00:32:58,360
<font color="#ffffff">If you need anything,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">please call us right away.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

436
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:07,320
<font color="#ffffff">We were so worried about you two.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

437
00:33:08,360 --> 00:33:10,480
<font color="#ffffff">We kept praying for everyone's safety.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

438
00:33:11,240 --> 00:33:14,280
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much for helping us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:33:14,360 --> 00:33:15,760
<font color="#ffffff">You're welcome.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">Where is Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

441
00:33:18,560 --> 00:33:19,600
<font color="#ffffff">How is he?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:33:21,320 --> 00:33:25,240
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea was taken</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">by the police for questioning.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

443
00:33:32,520 --> 00:33:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">After that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

444
00:33:34,560 --> 00:33:36,320
<font color="#ffffff">they sent us back,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

445
00:33:36,840 --> 00:33:38,720
<font color="#ffffff">and we heard nothing since.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

446
00:33:58,920 --> 00:34:00,040
<font color="#ffffff">How did it go?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

447
00:34:02,960 --> 00:34:05,880
<font color="#ffffff">We caught the monk working with Chansuek,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:34:06,600 --> 00:34:08,880
<font color="#ffffff">but we had to release him</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

449
00:34:08,960 --> 00:34:10,920
<font color="#ffffff">because a reporter found out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

450
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:13,280
<font color="#ffffff">And…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

451
00:34:14,159 --> 00:34:15,800
<font color="#ffffff">What did the monk say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

452
00:34:16,400 --> 00:34:17,400
<font color="#ffffff">Nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

453
00:34:17,960 --> 00:34:19,320
<font color="#ffffff">He kept quiet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

454
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:23,880
<font color="#ffffff">That monk</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

455
00:34:23,960 --> 00:34:25,600
<font color="#ffffff">is a former Border Patrol Police.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:29,000
<font color="#ffffff">I put him away for five years.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

457
00:34:30,080 --> 00:34:32,280
<font color="#ffffff">Now he's teaming up with Chansuek,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:34:33,120 --> 00:34:34,920
<font color="#ffffff">the guy who arrested him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:37,120
<font color="#ffffff">Then…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:34:38,120 --> 00:34:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">How did they end up working together?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

461
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:43,920
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:47,719
<font color="#ffffff">We still can't find Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

463
00:34:48,320 --> 00:34:50,360
<font color="#ffffff">and don't know how he is doing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:34:51,719 --> 00:34:53,040
<font color="#ffffff">Only that monk</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

465
00:34:53,120 --> 00:34:55,120
<font color="#ffffff">could give us answers.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:34:56,520 --> 00:34:57,520
<font color="#ffffff">In the past,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

467
00:34:58,200 --> 00:34:59,760
<font color="#ffffff">I could've handled this easily.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

468
00:35:00,360 --> 00:35:03,240
<font color="#ffffff">But these days,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">reporters have too much power.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

469
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">If they get involved,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

470
00:35:05,680 --> 00:35:07,000
<font color="#ffffff">it becomes a big deal,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

471
00:35:07,800 --> 00:35:09,440
<font color="#ffffff">and we'll be in trouble.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

472
00:35:16,520 --> 00:35:17,840
<font color="#ffffff">Right now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:35:19,600 --> 00:35:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">where is that monk?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

474
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">WANTED</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">BOUNTY 100,000 BAHT<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

475
00:35:40,040 --> 00:35:43,000
<font color="#ffffff">WANTED</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">CONTACT KAMNAN SAWAENG IF SEEN<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

476
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:51,920
<font color="#ffffff">Wait here. I'll go find out</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">what happened to Luang Pho.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

477
00:35:52,000 --> 00:35:54,680
<font color="#ffffff">Are you crazy? They're hunting you too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

478
00:35:54,760 --> 00:35:58,200
<font color="#ffffff">They won't recognize me with this hat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

479
00:35:58,960 --> 00:36:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">It's your voice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

480
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:03,040
<font color="#ffffff">Don't be silly. Just wait here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:36:03,120 --> 00:36:04,720
<font color="#ffffff">One of us getting caught is enough.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

482
00:36:04,800 --> 00:36:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">-But I think it's--</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Come on.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

483
00:36:06,920 --> 00:36:08,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's dangerous.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

484
00:36:14,800 --> 00:36:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">NORTHERN NEWS CENTER</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">MAE KHANING NEWS<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

485
00:37:00,600 --> 00:37:01,640
<font color="#ffffff">Freeze!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

486
00:37:05,160 --> 00:37:06,360
<font color="#ffffff">I am an officer.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

487
00:37:07,640 --> 00:37:08,680
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

488
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:12,040
<font color="#ffffff">You are the prime suspect</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in the diamond heist.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

489
00:37:12,640 --> 00:37:14,120
<font color="#ffffff">Taking us to Kamnan Sawaeng?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

490
00:37:14,200 --> 00:37:15,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not falling for that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

491
00:37:29,760 --> 00:37:31,120
<font color="#ffffff">Ya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

492
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:33,160
<font color="#ffffff">What now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

493
00:37:33,240 --> 00:37:34,760
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you take Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

494
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:39,200
<font color="#ffffff">Why should I tell you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

495
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:42,240
<font color="#ffffff">We still haven't found Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

496
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:45,120
<font color="#ffffff">Everyone needs information from Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

497
00:37:47,200 --> 00:37:49,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm worried about his safety,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

498
00:37:49,880 --> 00:37:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">so I'll send a team to guard him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

499
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:19,800
<font color="#ffffff">I know where Luang Pho is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

500
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:27,840
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

501
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:30,080
<font color="#ffffff">He's staying at the back shelter.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

502
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:32,640
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

503
00:38:32,720 --> 00:38:34,120
<font color="#ffffff">Bless you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

504
00:38:41,800 --> 00:38:42,760
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

505
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:45,800
<font color="#ffffff">Are you there?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

506
00:38:49,560 --> 00:38:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

507
00:38:51,240 --> 00:38:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">His bag is here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

508
00:38:58,640 --> 00:38:59,720
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

509
00:39:02,520 --> 00:39:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">Did you find him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

510
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:04,840
<font color="#ffffff">He's not inside.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

511
00:39:06,120 --> 00:39:07,640
<font color="#ffffff">Then where did he go?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

512
00:39:08,280 --> 00:39:09,800
<font color="#ffffff">His bag is right here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

513
00:39:12,480 --> 00:39:13,440
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

514
00:39:26,840 --> 00:39:27,920
<font color="#ffffff">Unless…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

515
00:39:38,480 --> 00:39:40,320
<font color="#ffffff">Did you find him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

516
00:39:40,400 --> 00:39:41,960
<font color="#ffffff">-No.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

517
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:45,240
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sure he was taken?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

518
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:48,640
<font color="#ffffff">Criminals always leave clues behind.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

519
00:39:48,720 --> 00:39:50,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sure</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

520
00:39:50,640 --> 00:39:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">he was kidnapped.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

521
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,080
<font color="#ffffff">What do we do now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

522
00:39:56,200 --> 00:39:57,480
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

523
00:40:03,040 --> 00:40:04,240
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

524
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:06,440
<font color="#ffffff">Someone kidnapped</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea before we could?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

525
00:40:07,040 --> 00:40:08,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

526
00:40:08,080 --> 00:40:09,800
<font color="#ffffff">I tried to stop them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

527
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:12,240
<font color="#ffffff">They just came out of nowhere.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

528
00:40:12,320 --> 00:40:13,760
<font color="#ffffff">They outnumbered us</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

529
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:15,440
<font color="#ffffff">and got away with him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

530
00:40:16,120 --> 00:40:18,240
<font color="#ffffff">It must be Kamnan Sawaeng's crew.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

531
00:41:00,160 --> 00:41:01,600
<font color="#ffffff">Come with us, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

532
00:41:02,720 --> 00:41:04,640
<font color="#ffffff">Well, hold on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

533
00:41:04,720 --> 00:41:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">Who…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

534
00:41:05,720 --> 00:41:07,400
<font color="#ffffff">Who are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

535
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:09,280
<font color="#ffffff">What business do you have with me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

536
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:12,640
<font color="#ffffff">Grab him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

537
00:41:12,720 --> 00:41:14,840
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, hold on!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

538
00:41:15,440 --> 00:41:17,000
<font color="#ffffff">Whoa!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

539
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, wait!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

540
00:41:25,080 --> 00:41:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">Won't you at least tell me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">why I'm being taken?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

541
00:41:28,920 --> 00:41:30,200
<font color="#ffffff">Get in, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

542
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">Please get in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

543
00:41:34,760 --> 00:41:35,880
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

544
00:41:36,880 --> 00:41:38,840
<font color="#ffffff">Hand the monk over to me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

545
00:41:56,640 --> 00:41:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">Let's get in!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

546
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

547
00:42:10,680 --> 00:42:11,880
<font color="#ffffff">But Paul…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

548
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:13,000
<font color="#ffffff">From what I saw,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

549
00:42:13,680 --> 00:42:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sure</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

550
00:42:15,240 --> 00:42:17,520
<font color="#ffffff">none of them were Kamnan Sawaeng's men.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

551
00:42:19,880 --> 00:42:22,080
<font color="#ffffff">He wouldn't use his own men.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

552
00:42:22,680 --> 00:42:24,320
<font color="#ffffff">Otherwise, the police would know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

553
00:42:28,560 --> 00:42:29,760
<font color="#ffffff">All right then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

554
00:42:30,880 --> 00:42:32,560
<font color="#ffffff">Track them down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

555
00:42:32,640 --> 00:42:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">Find out where they took the monk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

556
00:42:36,680 --> 00:42:38,000
<font color="#ffffff">Then we can snatch him back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

557
00:42:38,600 --> 00:42:39,720
<font color="#ffffff">Got it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

558
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:49,280
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, wait!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

559
00:42:49,360 --> 00:42:50,760
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

560
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:52,080
<font color="#ffffff">Think about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

561
00:42:52,160 --> 00:42:55,960
<font color="#ffffff">If you go to the police now,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and they throw you in jail, what then?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

562
00:42:58,920 --> 00:43:00,200
<font color="#ffffff">I don't care.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

563
00:43:01,000 --> 00:43:03,480
<font color="#ffffff">We can't just let Luang Pho</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">disappear like this.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

564
00:43:04,680 --> 00:43:06,200
<font color="#ffffff">How can we be sure</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

565
00:43:06,280 --> 00:43:08,800
<font color="#ffffff">those cops aren't working</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for Kamnan Sawaeng<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

566
00:43:08,880 --> 00:43:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">or the people hunting you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

567
00:43:13,440 --> 00:43:16,040
<font color="#ffffff">You've already learned your lesson that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

568
00:43:16,640 --> 00:43:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">the police can't be trusted.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

569
00:43:18,640 --> 00:43:19,640
<font color="#ffffff">But Luang Pho</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

570
00:43:19,720 --> 00:43:21,880
<font color="#ffffff">could be in danger.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

571
00:43:22,760 --> 00:43:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

572
00:43:29,560 --> 00:43:31,040
<font color="#ffffff">What happened to him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

573
00:43:34,880 --> 00:43:35,920
<font color="#ffffff">Are you…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

574
00:43:38,200 --> 00:43:39,600
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

575
00:43:41,680 --> 00:43:43,080
<font color="#ffffff">Hold on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

576
00:43:43,160 --> 00:43:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">Who are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

577
00:43:45,160 --> 00:43:47,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'm Saranya, a reporter.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

578
00:43:48,920 --> 00:43:50,360
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you remember me at all?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

579
00:43:53,960 --> 00:43:55,480
<font color="#ffffff">This looks bad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

580
00:43:55,560 --> 00:43:56,560
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

581
00:43:58,240 --> 00:44:00,800
<font color="#ffffff">Wait! Where are you going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

582
00:44:01,400 --> 00:44:03,240
<font color="#ffffff">What happened to Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

583
00:44:12,600 --> 00:44:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm worried about him too!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

584
00:44:31,640 --> 00:44:35,720
<font color="#ffffff">Why did they lock us up here, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

585
00:44:37,400 --> 00:44:39,560
<font color="#ffffff">How should I know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

586
00:44:42,680 --> 00:44:45,280
<font color="#ffffff">The bad guys are here!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

587
00:44:55,160 --> 00:44:56,640
<font color="#ffffff">Where am I,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

588
00:44:56,720 --> 00:44:59,080
<font color="#ffffff">and why did you bring me here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

589
00:45:15,400 --> 00:45:17,040
<font color="#ffffff">Hello, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

590
00:45:25,040 --> 00:45:26,720
<font color="#ffffff">Who are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

591
00:45:26,800 --> 00:45:28,880
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you kidnap me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

592
00:45:29,480 --> 00:45:30,880
<font color="#ffffff">My name is Yok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

593
00:45:31,600 --> 00:45:33,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'm the owner of the missing diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

594
00:45:36,480 --> 00:45:37,600
<font color="#ffffff">Look.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

595
00:45:38,720 --> 00:45:40,960
<font color="#ffffff">If you wanted to ask about the diamond,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

596
00:45:41,040 --> 00:45:42,680
<font color="#ffffff">you could have asked nicely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

597
00:45:42,760 --> 00:45:44,600
<font color="#ffffff">Why treat me like this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

598
00:45:45,560 --> 00:45:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">Oh dear!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

599
00:45:50,520 --> 00:45:51,760
<font color="#ffffff">Untie him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

600
00:46:00,160 --> 00:46:02,800
<font color="#ffffff">I apologize, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

601
00:46:03,920 --> 00:46:05,560
<font color="#ffffff">I told them</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

602
00:46:05,640 --> 00:46:07,760
<font color="#ffffff">to invite you here,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

603
00:46:07,840 --> 00:46:09,200
<font color="#ffffff">but I didn't expect them</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

604
00:46:09,280 --> 00:46:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">to be so rude to you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

605
00:46:13,880 --> 00:46:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">Never mind.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

606
00:46:15,840 --> 00:46:17,480
<font color="#ffffff">What do you want to ask me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

607
00:46:18,040 --> 00:46:18,960
<font color="#ffffff">Go ahead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

608
00:46:20,840 --> 00:46:23,440
<font color="#ffffff">You're working with the diamond thief,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

609
00:46:23,520 --> 00:46:24,760
<font color="#ffffff">aren't you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

610
00:46:30,560 --> 00:46:32,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'm a monk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

611
00:46:32,320 --> 00:46:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">I observe my precepts.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

612
00:46:34,520 --> 00:46:36,160
<font color="#ffffff">I would never do that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

613
00:46:36,240 --> 00:46:38,880
<font color="#ffffff">let alone work with a thief.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

614
00:46:40,640 --> 00:46:43,280
<font color="#ffffff">But you were with Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

615
00:46:48,280 --> 00:46:50,000
<font color="#ffffff">How can you be so sure</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

616
00:46:50,800 --> 00:46:53,680
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod is Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

617
00:46:53,760 --> 00:46:56,360
<font color="#ffffff">when it hasn't been reported in the news?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

618
00:46:58,560 --> 00:47:00,120
<font color="#ffffff">The police told me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

619
00:47:04,160 --> 00:47:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">Then you should know that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

620
00:47:06,880 --> 00:47:09,400
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod isn't a thief.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

621
00:47:10,080 --> 00:47:12,960
<font color="#ffffff">He's just a cop doing his job.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

622
00:47:13,040 --> 00:47:14,640
<font color="#ffffff">If he's not a thief,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

623
00:47:15,200 --> 00:47:17,400
<font color="#ffffff">why hasn't he returned it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

624
00:47:17,480 --> 00:47:20,040
<font color="#ffffff">Are you even sure the diamond</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

625
00:47:20,800 --> 00:47:22,200
<font color="#ffffff">is with him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

626
00:47:23,040 --> 00:47:24,840
<font color="#ffffff">What do you mean</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

627
00:47:25,360 --> 00:47:26,840
<font color="#ffffff">by that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

628
00:47:34,720 --> 00:47:36,400
<font color="#ffffff">Aren't you curious</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

629
00:47:36,480 --> 00:47:38,040
<font color="#ffffff">to see if pure faith</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

630
00:47:38,720 --> 00:47:40,080
<font color="#ffffff">can actually</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

631
00:47:40,640 --> 00:47:42,120
<font color="#ffffff">triumph over</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

632
00:47:42,200 --> 00:47:43,280
<font color="#ffffff">sin and malice?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

633
00:47:43,920 --> 00:47:46,760
<font color="#ffffff">Wow, wearing the full uniform like this,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

634
00:47:46,840 --> 00:47:48,600
<font color="#ffffff">you actually look quite handsome.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

635
00:47:48,680 --> 00:47:51,960
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

636
00:47:52,040 --> 00:47:55,240
<font color="#ffffff">If you don't hand over</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho to me now,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

637
00:47:55,320 --> 00:47:57,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'll burn this place to the ground.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

638
00:47:59,760 --> 00:48:01,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad you did that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

639
00:48:03,160 --> 00:48:05,880
<font color="#ffffff">It makes me realize</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you don't know who I really am.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

640
00:48:06,800 --> 00:48:08,360
<font color="#ffffff">We need to hurry</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

641
00:48:08,440 --> 00:48:10,520
<font color="#ffffff">before the police track us down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

642
00:48:14,480 --> 00:48:15,480
<font color="#ffffff">They're here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

643
00:48:15,560 --> 00:48:17,360
<font color="#ffffff">-They're here!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

644
